  "explanation_text": "\n$\\theta=\\sin^{-1}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}$: $\\sin\\theta=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}$, $\\cos\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}$ ⇒ $\\sec\\theta=\\sqrt{5}$।\n∴ $\\sec^{2}\\theta=5$।\n\nব্যাখ্যা: $\\sec^{2}=5$।\n"
 },
 "e8e43bca-7e6e-44db-8438-af3b0c2dbbdd": {
